{"id":"e9c2daf67c9f2e7b","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md","title":"真理与PA可证性的严格区分","display":"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability — 真理与PA可证性的严格区分","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability","aliases":["91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability","91-thm-truth-stronger-provability"],"display":"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability — 真理与PA可证性的严格区分","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","[[91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability</span><span>91-thm-truth-stronger-provability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability — 真理与PA可证性的严格区分"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c289f1c721012496\" href=\"?note=c289f1c721012496\" title=\"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability\">91-thm-Tarski-undefinability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"719296019c11ec36\" href=\"?note=719296019c11ec36\" title=\"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness\">91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability-—-真理与-PA-可证性的严格区分\">thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability — 真理与 PA 可证性的严格区分</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (标准自然数结构)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> (可递归公理化且对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 可靠的 Peano 算术)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> (PA 的基础语言定理集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\ \\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\ \\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\}\\)</span> (PA 定理的编码集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 中为真的基础语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> (PA 的标准可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\)</span> (恰有一个自由变元的一元算术公式类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)\\)</span>\n(公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 在标准模型中定义集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}than\\text{-}provability}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\subsetneq\n\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}than\\text{-}provability}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\subsetneq\n\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}than\\text{-}provability}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\in\n\\bigl(\\Sigma^0_1\\cap\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}than\\text{-}provability}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\in\n\\bigl(\\Sigma^0_1\\cap\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式是元理论结论。可靠性给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；\n可递归公理化、足够算术强度与一致性再由 Gödel–Rosser 不完全性给出严格性。\n第二式把表达能力区分开：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\)</span> 是左侧的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^0_1\">\\(\\Sigma^0_1\\)</span> 定义公式，而标准算术真理集不能由任何单个算术公式定义。</p>\n<p>这两点不能直接改写成任意真理理论内部的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)\\)</span>。\n要在对象理论中得到这种全局声性，必须另外验证该理论具有证明归纳、\n真理化反射以及相应的释放原则。TB 或 UTB 仅凭双条件模式并不自动获得\n这些原则；“语义真理严格包含 PA 定理”也不等于“每个真理理论都在算术上\n强于 PA”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability-—-真理与-PA-可证性的严格区分","text":"thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability — 真理与 PA 可证性的严格区分","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-Tarski-undefinability","status":"resolved","id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"719296019c11ec36","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-incompleteness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\ \\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}(\\rho,A)\\coloneqq\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n(\\mathbb N\\models\\rho(\\overline n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}than\\text{-}provability}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\n\\subsetneq\n\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}truth\\text{-}predicate\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}than\\text{-}provability}\n\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\in\n\\bigl(\\Sigma^0_1\\cap\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\operatorname{ThCode}(\\mathrm{PA})\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\\,\n\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathbb N}\n\\bigl(\\tau,\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{PA})\\subseteq\\mathrm{True}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^0_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(x)\\to T(x)","display":false}],"bytes":2791,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemm